{"version":1,"content":"<p>魏浚笙（Jeffrey）有份主演的ViuTV劇集《地獄大狀》，下周大結局，前晚（15日）一集講到潘燦良飾演恐同大律師「馬鈞豪」，堅持其同性戀女兒「馬思明」（伍詠詩飾）遺體，要在香港火化，但思明遺願是希望她的太太帶遺體返澳洲落葬，而邱蔭蔭（林愷鈴飾）為助亡友完成心願，打算拍片威脅馬鈞豪。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T09:39:36.541439+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:15:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T16:37:32.303392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T09:37:33.354306+00:00","content_hash":"a1b9c1a5c5fe6841ca54dabaeb46885a9324411ff09958740a11ccb240a3e624","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}